WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:09.304
<v Audio Description>Visual scene one: Card one lights up amber beside a 3D orbital arc where a rose unit-mismatch vector veers off course, marking the Mars mission loss.

2
00:00:09.644 --> 00:00:16.757
<v Presenter>First, single handoff failures carry exact price tags, like losing a Mars mission over mismatched units.

3
00:00:17.097 --> 00:00:25.659
<v Audio Description>Visual scene two: Card two glows cyan as broad slate survey clouds separate aggregate software estimates from isolated boundary measurements.

4
00:00:25.999 --> 00:00:33.550
<v Presenter>Second, giant national software-failure numbers come from broad surveys and models, never counting handoffs alone.

5
00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:42.533
<v Audio Description>Visual scene three: Card three shines emerald as a thin, inexpensive upfront check ring shields an entire downstream fan of cyan team nodes.

6
00:00:42.873 --> 00:00:48.729
<v Presenter>Third, checking what each side assumes is cheap, but one team pays while everyone else benefits.
